    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d254">

                <pb facs="0490" n="428" sameAs="frus:frus1944Quebec/pg428"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">J.C.S.
                    Files</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the United States Chiefs of
                    Staff</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        C.C.S. 674/1</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Quebec</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1944-09-12">12 September 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Assumption of Command of “Dragoon” Forces by Supreme Commander,
                        Allied Expeditionary Force</hi></p>
                <p>The United States Chiefs of Staff recommend that the following message be sent to
                        SCAEF and SACMed at once:<anchor n="1" xml:id="d254-f1"/></p>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>“Effective 15 September SCAEF will assume
                        command of <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Dragoon</hi> forces according to plan recommended in <hi rendition="#small-caps">Scaf</hi>
                            77.”<anchor n="2" xml:id="d254-f2"/></p>
                </quote>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d254-f1" n="1" xml:id="d254-f1-content">
                <p>The dispatch of the message quoted below was approved by the Combined Chiefs of
                    Staff at their 172d Meeting, September 12, 1944. See <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg306">p. 306</ref>. The message was sent as
                    telegram No. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >Facs</hi> 76.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d254-f2" n="2" xml:id="d254-f2-content">
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg232">p. 232</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
